7299804688], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 179, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "showAllGraphs": true, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "Qwen3", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "max one"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["236299f4cb57c4878854fc66934ba96f6b1de8fdc1bc06866bf8f4c331bada9a.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [467.27667236328125, 745.9716796875], "pos": [3050.031494140625, -693.6150512695312], "id": 81, "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "links": [], "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["李老汉：（摩挲着仙盆边缘，面露犹豫，语气带着期许与顾虑）仙童，如今村中闹饥荒，不少乡亲都快饿死了，我能不能用仙盆多生些粮食，分给大家？\n\n青玄仙童：（眼中含笑，语气赞许，微微点头）你能舍己为人，正合仙盆初心！聚宝仙盆本就是为济世而生，善心越重，生万物越顺，且不会遭反噬。\n\n李老汉：（大喜过望，眼眶微热，语气激动）多谢仙童成全！那我这就生些粮食，再生些种子，让乡亲们能种粮糊口，不用再挨饿！\n\n王小二：（气喘吁吁跑过来，额角冒汗，眼神急切，语气带着恳求）李大爷，听说你有仙盆能生粮食？俺娘快饿晕了，能不能先给俺家些？\n\n李老汉：（连忙舀出半袋粮食递给王小二，笑容温和）拿着！这仙盆能生万物，咱们全村人都能吃饱，以后大家一起种粮，日子定会好起来！\n\n青玄仙童：（点头颔首，身形渐渐变得透明，语气温和）凡人向善，便是功德。此盆便暂留你处，助你惠及乡邻，待饥荒平息，我再来取回便是。\n\n李老汉：（对着仙童消失的方向作揖，连连道谢，语气郑重）多谢仙童！老汉定不负所托，用仙盆好好帮衬乡亲，绝无半分私心！"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [476.0050964355469, 318.2926330566406], "pos": [3038.837890625, 410.7182922363281], "id": 182, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["# 📢              工作流使用介绍            📢\n---\n## 🎭Qwen3-TTS VoiceClone-语音克隆1️⃣ ▶模仿已有的人物声音来合成\n```\n# 第一步：加载模仿的声音\n# 第二步：输入想要说的文字内容\n# 第三步：点击运行\n```\n## 🎵 Qwen3-TTS CustomVoice-自定义语音：从音色列表【speaker】里找2️⃣\n```\n# 第一步：输入想要说的文字内容\n# 第二步：从音色列表【speaker】里找语种\n# 第三步：点击运行\n```\n## 🎨Qwen3-TTS VoiceDesign-语音设计3️⃣+✅音色设计指令：为Qwen3-TTS 模型编写极高精度的指令4️⃣\n```\n# 第一步：输入想要说的文字内容\n# 第二步：设计人物声音类型以及情感表现\n# 第三步：点击运行\n```\n---\n# 🍺 资源说明 🍺\n# 💫本地电脑带不动，可以直接使用本云端💫\n# ⭐RH平台有我大部分工作流：点赞+收藏\n# 👉[RH最新工作流](https://www.runninghub.cn/user-center/1942606778829766658/userPost?inviteCode=iehpvxyi)    👈点击可直接跳转\n\n---\n# 💫需要定制工作流的可以私我💫\n# 💬+V：yandingad2（请注明来意）\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "傲雪AICG工作流使用介绍", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [471.875732421875, 726.3423461914062], "pos": [3044.67236328125, -1470.3463134765625], "id": 82, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 217, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "SaveAudio", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [493.7024230957031, 243.0662841796875], "pos": [5631.74365234375, -28.061864